<h2 id=3D"3">OSEC-2026-28: github.com/ocaml/ocaml.org: Unauthenticated arbi=
trary file read via path traversal in <code>/conferences/ocaml/**</code></h=
2>
<div class=3D"outline-text-2" id=3D"text-3">
</div>
<div id=3D"outline-container-org372f571" class=3D"outline-3">
<h3 id=3D"org372f571">Hannes Mehnert announced</h3>
<div class=3D"outline-text-3" id=3D"text-org372f571">
<p>
Dear everyone,
</p>

<p>
a new advisory was published for the <a href=3D"https://github.com/ocaml/oc=
aml.org">https://github.com/ocaml/ocaml.org</a>=20
website source code. Below is the advisory, you can as well find it at=20
<a href=3D"https://github.com/ocaml/security-advisories">https://github.com=
/ocaml/security-advisories</a> and=20
<a href=3D"https://osv.dev/list?q=3D&amp;ecosystem=3Dopam">https://osv.dev/=
list?q=3D&amp;ecosystem=3Dopam</a>
</p>

<p>
Please note that according to the system administrator, the ocaml.org=20
server is run inside a docker container where no secret material is present.
</p>

<p>
Best,
</p>

<p>
Hannes
</p>

<pre class=3D"example" id=3D"org8f2a53f">
