 4.14</h4>
<div class=3D"outline-text-4" id=3D"text-orga9cd54c">
<p>
As an important announcement, in January 2027, we will start evaluating if =
it would be reasonable to stop the active maintenance of the 4.14 branch be=
tween January and June 2027, taking in account that maintaining 4.14 is bec=
oming more arduous each passing year.
</p>

<p>
If this evaluation does not reveal any major issues, we would stop the acti=
ve maintenance of OCaml 4.14 between June 2027 and the end of 2027. OCaml 4=
.14 would still be available, and we would still try to keep the branch com=
patible with newer OSs and C compilers on a best effort basis.
</p>

<p>
In the meanwhile, do not hesitate to report any bugs on the <a href=3D"http=
s://github.com/ocaml/ocaml/issues">OCaml issue tracker</a>.
</p>

<p>
Happy hacking,
Florian Angeletti for the OCaml team.
</p>
